                         ? "过滤通过｜6场自动奖金：¥\(String(format: "%.2f", prizeDisplayedAmount(snapshot.estimatedPrize)))"
                         : "过滤未通过｜不计算6场奖金")
                        .font(.subheadline.weight(.semibold))
